# Internal-only documents. Kept on the local working tree for
# agent and developer reference, but must not appear in the public
# repository. These files were committed in the initial public
# release; the matching `git rm --cached` is part of the same
# recovery commit so future pushes do not include them.
#
# `AGENTS.md` is the agent rule book.
# `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` and `docs/ROADMAP.md` are the internal
# canonical architecture and roadmap.
# `design/` holds the per-section design drafts that were stitched
# into ARCHITECTURE.md; they are not intended for public review.
/AGENTS.md
/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
/docs/ROADMAP.md
/design/

# Coverage and test artifacts
**/coverage/
**/.nyc_output/
**/lcov.info
**/tarpaulin-report.html

